---
import Layout from './Layout.astro';
import pax from './assets/gav-and-pax.webp?url';
import pigeon from './assets/pigeon-editorial.webp?url';
import seek from './assets/seek-mascot.webp?url';
import nyah from './assets/nyah-mascot.webp?url';
import dog from './assets/dog.svg?url';
import portrait from './assets/gav-illustrated.webp?url';
const story = '/design/post/from-burnout-to-building-a-conversation-on-design-ai-and-leading-authentically/';
---
<Layout title="About me | Gav Elliott">
 <main id="main" tabindex="-1" class="about-edition">
  <header class="about-cover">
   <div class="about-hello"><h1>I’m<br/>Gav<span>.</span></h1><p class="about-intro">Geordie. Designer. Maker of things.</p><p>I lead design at Deel, build apps through Crafted by Fort and write here. It’s all me.</p><a class="about-link" href="#bits">A few bits of the story ↓</a></div>
   <figure class="about-photo"><img src={portrait} alt="Illustrated portrait of me, Gav Elliott, in glasses and a green polo shirt" width="720" height="900" fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption>Gav Elliott. In green, obviously.</figcaption><span class="about-stamp" aria-hidden="true">MADE IN<br/>THE NORTH<br/>EAST</span></figure>
  </header>
  <div class="about-strip" aria-hidden="true"><span>Design</span><span>Dogs</span><span>Words</span><span>Games</span><span>Green</span></div>
  <section id="bits" class="about-bits" aria-labelledby="bits-title">
   <header><p class="eyebrow">A few things that stuck</p><h2 id="bits-title">There was a fair bit<br/>before the apps.</h2><p>Before the British Army, I was writing gaming and gaming hardware reviews for NVmax. Then I became an Army mechanic. Design came later.</p></header>
   <div class="about-scraps">
    <article class="about-computer"><div class="about-windowbar" aria-hidden="true"><span>GAV / EARLY INTERNET</span><span>■</span></div><div class="about-screen"><p class="about-terminal-label">DIRECTORY: NVmax</p><h3>Before the<br/>job titles.</h3><p>I wrote gaming reviews for NVmax, along with reviews of gaming-related hardware.</p><details><summary>Open the old directory <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div><p>Gaming and hardware were part of my life before the Army and before design became my job.</p><a href={story}>More of that story →</a></div></details></div><div class="about-computer-foot" aria-hidden="true"><span>●</span><span>STILL FIGURING THINGS OUT</span></div></article>
    <article class="about-ticket"><div class="about-ticket-top"><span>From the archive</span><span>Four events</span></div><h3>Industry</h3><p class="about-ticket-sub">An event for web professionals</p><div class="about-ticket-body"><p>I organised Industry. Put the line-up together, brought people over and worried about whether anyone would buy a ticket.</p><p>I ran four events in Newcastle, from 2013 to 2016. Speakers came from around the world to share things people could actually use in their work.</p><a href="https://industryconf.com">Visit the Industry archive →</a></div><div class="about-ticket-stub"><span>ORGANISER</span><strong>GAV ELLIOTT</strong><span class="about-barcode" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></article>
   </div>
  </section>
  <section class="about-now" aria-labelledby="now-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">These days</p><h2 id="now-title">Still making<br/>things.</h2></div><div><p>I lead design in Core, the group of teams building the foundations of Deel. That covers AI, Design System, Platform, Settings, Motion and Animation, Mobile, Home and Analytics.</p><p>Then there are my own apps. Dog walking software, a wardrobe app, games and the other ideas I’ve decided to do something about.</p><a class="about-link" href="/design/work/">See what I’m working on →</a></div><div class="about-parade" aria-label="Some of my apps"><a href="/design/work/roundtails/"><img src={dog} alt="" width="600" height="420" loading="lazy"/><span>Roundtails</span></a><a href="/design/work/#nyah"><img src={nyah} alt="" width="360" height="360" loading="lazy"/><span>Nyah</span></a><a href="/design/work/#seek"><img src={seek} alt="" width="360" height="360" loading="lazy"/><span>Seek</span></a><a href="/design/work/#pigeon-toss"><img src={pigeon} alt="" width="360" height="360" loading="lazy"/><span>Pigeon Toss</span></a></div></section>
  <section class="about-understanding" aria-labelledby="understanding-title"><div class="about-margin"><span aria-hidden="true">*</span><p>A more recent<br/>piece of the story.</p></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Understanding myself</p><h2 id="understanding-title">A different<br/>explanation.</h2><p>I gave more than 120 talks about impostor syndrome. Being diagnosed as autistic later in life changed how I understood a lot of what I’d been talking about.</p><blockquote><p>“I no longer interpret every difficult internal moment as evidence that something is wrong with me.”</p></blockquote><p>I’ve written about that shift. It’s personal, and I’m still thinking about it.</p><a class="about-link" href="/design/post/i-dont-think-about-impostor-syndrome-in-the-same-way-anymore/">How I think about it now →</a></div></section>
  <section class="about-offcuts" aria-label="A few more bits of me"><article class="about-pax"><figure><img src={pax} alt="Illustration of me with Pax as a puppy in the garden" width="800" height="450" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><figcaption>Me and Pax. He’s a bit bigger now.</figcaption></figure><h2>And this is Pax.</h2><p>He’s had the same dog walker since he was a pup. Seeing the admin around her business is what got me started on Roundtails.</p><a class="about-link" href="/design/work/roundtails/">Pax’s contribution to software →</a></article><div class="about-small-bits"><article class="about-green"><p class="eyebrow">Favourite colour. Obviously.</p><h2>Green.</h2><p>There may have been a few clues.</p><details><summary>How green? <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="about-swatches"><span style="--swatch:#075331">Forest<br/>#075331</span><span style="--swatch:#c6f135;color:#172017">Seek<br/>#C6F135</span><span style="--swatch:#23764a">A bit more<br/>green.</span></div></details></article><article class="about-books"><p class="eyebrow">On the shelf</p><h2>Other people’s<br/>words.</h2><p>Books I’ve read and would recommend. With the reasons I’ve kept recommending them.</p><a class="about-link" href="/design/books/">Have a look at the books →</a></article></div></section>
  <section class="about-end"><h2>Anyway.<br/>That’s me.</h2><div><p>The writing is probably the best way to get to know me. There’s quite a bit of it.</p><a class="about-link" href="/design/writing/">Get into the writing →</a><a class="about-link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/gavin-elliott-1326a741/">Find me on LinkedIn →</a></div></section>
 </main>
</Layout>
<style is:inline>
.about-edition{padding:30px 0}.about-edition h1,.about-edition h2,.about-edition h3{font-family:var(--display);text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:400;word-break:normal;overflow-wrap:normal;hyphens:none}.about-edition h2{font-size:clamp(30px,4.1vw,56px);line-height:1.14;letter-spacing:-.025em}.about-edition p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:19px;line-height:1.7}.about-edition .eyebrow{line-height:1.5;font-size:12px}.about-link{display:inline-block;font:700 14px/1.6 var(--ui);padding:12px 0}.about-cover{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;gap:50px;align-items:center;padding:10px 0 35px}.about-hello h1{font-size:clamp(95px,15vw,210px);line-height:.94;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:22px 0}.about-hello h1 span{color:var(--green)}.about-hello p{max-width:480px}.about-hello .about-intro{font-size:clamp(22px,2.3vw,32px);line-height:1.35;margin:25px 0 18px}.about-photo{margin:0;position:relative;padding:12px 12px 0;background:var(--green);color:var(--paper);transform:rotate(2deg)}.about-photo img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover;display:block}.about-photo figcaption{font:700 12px/1.5 var(--ui);padding:13px 3px}.about-stamp{position:absolute;right:-10px;bottom:70px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--yellow);color:var(--ink);width:135px;height:135px;display:grid;place-content:center;text-align:center;font:400 24px/1 var(--display);transform:rotate(-12deg);border:3px solid var(--ink)}.about-strip{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr));border-block:3px solid var(--ink);padding:14px 0;font:400 clamp(18px,2.7vw,36px)/1 var(--display);text-transform:uppercase}.about-strip span{position:relative;text-align:center}.about-strip span+span:before{content:'✳';position:absolute;left:0;transform:translateX(-50%);color:var(--green)}.about-bits{padding:45px 0}.about-bits>header{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;gap:14px 50px;align-items:end}.about-bits>header>.eyebrow{grid-column:1/-1;margin:0}.about-scraps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;gap:50px;padding:38px 8px 15px;align-items:center}.about-computer{background:#d9d3bc;border:3px solid var(--ink);padding:12px;box-shadow:7px 7px 0 var(--ink);border-radius:12px}.about-windowbar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font:700 12px/1.4 var(--ui);padding:2px 3px 12px;gap:10px}.about-screen{padding:26px;background:var(--ink);color:#d6edab;border-radius:5px}.about-screen .about-terminal-label{font:14px/1.5 monospace;margin-bottom:16px}.about-screen h3{font-size:clamp(30px,3.6vw,48px);line-height:1.13;margin-bottom:18px}.about-screen>p{font-size:17px!important}.about-edition summary{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;list-style:none;min-height:48px;font:700 14px/1.5 var(--ui);padding:14px 0}.about-edition summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.about-edition summary span{font-size:24px;transition:transform 180ms ease}.about-edition details[open] summary span{transform:rotate(45deg)}.about-screen details{border-top:1px solid #7f9a63;margin-top:24px}.about-screen details p{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:15px}.about-screen details a{font:700 14px/1.6 var(--ui)}.about-computer-foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:15px 4px 2px;font:700 10px/1.4 var(--ui)}.about-computer-foot>span:first-child{color:var(--green);font-size:20px}.about-ticket{background:var(--yellow);border:2px solid var(--ink);transform:rotate(-2deg)}.about-ticket-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:14px 22px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink);font:700 12px/1.5 var(--ui);text-transform:uppercase}.about-ticket h3{font-size:clamp(30px,4.3vw,60px);letter-spacing:-.03em;padding:22px 22px 0}.about-ticket .about-ticket-sub{font:700 12px/1.5 var(--ui);padding:6px 22px 0}.about-ticket-body{padding:20px 22px}.about-ticket-body p{font-size:17px!important;margin-bottom:16px}.about-ticket-body a{font:700 14px/1.6 var(--ui)}.about-ticket-stub{border-top:2px dashed var(--ink);padding:20px 22px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 70px;gap:6px;font:700 11px/1.4 var(--ui)}.about-ticket-stub strong{font-size:18px;grid-column:1}.about-barcode{grid-column:2;grid-row:1/3;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,var(--ink) 0 2px,transparent 2px 5px,var(--ink) 5px 9px,transparent 9px 11px)}.about-now{border-block:2px solid var(--ink);padding:35px 0 24px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.3fr;gap:24px 55px}.about-now p+p{margin-top:16px}.about-parade{grid-column:1/-1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:25px}.about-parade a{text-align:center;font:700 13px/1.5 var(--ui);text-decoration:none;padding:12px 0}.about-parade a:hover span{text-decoration:underline}.about-parade img{display:block;width:100%;height:150px;object-fit:contain;margin-bottom:10px;transition:transform 180ms ease}.about-parade a:hover img{transform:translateY(-5px) rotate(-3deg)}.about-understanding{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 2fr;gap:55px;padding:55px 0}.about-understanding>div:last-child{max-width:720px}.about-understanding h2{margin-bottom:22px}.about-margin>span{display:block;font:400 220px/.8 var(--display);color:var(--green)}.about-margin>p{font-style:italic;margin-top:20px}.about-understanding blockquote{margin:25px 0;padding:18px 0 18px 24px;border-left:6px solid var(--green)}.about-understanding blockquote p{font-size:clamp(23px,2.6vw,34px);line-height:1.5}.about-offcuts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.25fr 1fr;gap:45px;border-top:2px solid var(--ink);padding:35px 0}.about-pax figure{margin:0 0 22px}.about-pax img{display:block;width:100%;border:2px solid var(--ink)}.about-pax figcaption{font:700 12px/1.5 var(--ui);padding:10px 0}.about-pax h2{font-size:clamp(29px,3vw,42px);margin-bottom:18px}.about-small-bits{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:30px}.about-green{background:var(--green);color:var(--paper);padding:26px}.about-green h2{font-size:clamp(45px,5vw,72px);margin:15px 0}.about-green details{border-top:1px solid #a2b493;margin-top:18px}.about-swatches{display:flex;gap:8px;padding-top:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}.about-swatches>span{background:var(--swatch);border:1px solid currentColor;padding:15px 10px;flex:1;font:700 11px/1.6 var(--ui)}.about-books{padding:0 26px}.about-books h2{font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,40px);margin-bottom:18px}.about-end{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.3fr;gap:40px;padding:35px 0 15px;border-top:3px solid var(--ink);align-items:center}.about-end>div{max-width:580px}.about-end a{margin-right:22px}
@media(max-width:900px){.about-cover{gap:30px}.about-stamp{width:105px;height:105px;font-size:19px;right:-5px}.about-scraps{gap:28px}.about-screen{padding:20px}.about-understanding{gap:30px}.about-offcuts{gap:28px}.about-now{gap:24px 30px}}
@media(max-width:650px){.about-edition{padding-top:22px}.about-cover{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:25px}.about-hello h1{font-size:clamp(90px,25vw,150px);line-height:1;margin:15px 0}.about-hello h1 br{display:block}.about-photo{margin:0 9px 10px}.about-photo img{aspect-ratio:1/1}.about-stamp{bottom:58px}.about-strip{font-size:clamp(10px,2.7vw,18px)}.about-strip span+span:before{font-size:.75em;top:.15em}.about-bits{padding:30px 0}.about-bits>header,.about-scraps,.about-now,.about-understanding,.about-offcuts,.about-end{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:24px}.about-bits>header{gap:12px}.about-scraps{padding:26px 7px 12px}.about-screen{padding:20px 16px}.about-ticket{margin-top:12px}.about-ticket h3{font-size:clamp(30px,10vw,52px)}.about-now{padding:28px 0 20px}.about-parade{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}.about-parade img{height:120px}.about-understanding{padding:32px 0}.about-margin{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px}.about-margin>span{font-size:80px;line-height:.8}.about-margin>p{margin:0;font-size:16px!important}.about-edition p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:18px}.about-understanding blockquote p{font-size:24px}.about-green,.about-books{padding:24px}.about-books{padding-bottom:0}.about-end{padding-top:28px}.about-end a{display:block;margin:0}}
</style>
